'''Squire Rel''' (リッスントゥミー, ''Rissuntumī'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Empire of Cats|Main Chapters]], [[Legend Stages]] and [[Catclaw Dojo]]. They were added in [[Version 1.0 Update|Version 1.0]].

