==Enemy==
Yet another basic peon, just with quick attack speed and high speed in general. Squire Rel is the fastest enemy in [[Empire of Cats]], with 30 speed, but rarely does more than just get in the way, due to their low health and attack power. Their short range makes them vulnerable to attack by almost any unit, and they usually appear in clusters as easily defeatable peons throughout the entire game.

==Strategy==
A lone Squire Rel dies quickly to one [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]]. Groups of Squire Rels can be killed by a [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]], [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Rocker Cat]] or an [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|Area Attacker]] like [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Bird Cat]] or [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]]. [[Wave Attack]]s from the [[Cat Cannon]] or any [[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|Wave]]/[[:Category:Surge Attack Cats|Surge]]/[[:Category:Explosion Cats|Explosion]] cat can clear out a horde of Squire Rels in one shot.

